  <data name="SubtitleDashboard.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Windows, Microsoft Defender ve Yerel YARA Motorundan canlı doğrulanan güvenlik durumu.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="SubtitleScan.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Dual local scanning powered by the built-in Native YARA Engine (VirusTotal/yara x64) and Microsoft Defender (MpCmdRun). Every result is real — never simulated.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="AskAiAboutScanButton.Content" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Ask BECETTI AI to explain this</value>
  </data>
  <data name="SubtitleProtection.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Verified Microsoft Defender state. Changes are applied through Defender and re-verified before success is reported.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="SubtitleCloud.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Connect to the BECETTI SECURITY cloud API for reputation checks, update information, and a multi-device dashboard. Only file hashes are sent — never files.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="CloudDevicesSectionLabel.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Your devices</value>
  </data>
  <data name="CloudDevicesSectionNote.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Every device that has signed in to this cloud account and sent a check-in, including this one. Remove a device if it is lost or no longer in use.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="CloudRefreshDevicesButton.Content" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Yenile</value>
  </data>
  <data name="CloudThisDeviceBadge.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>(this device)</value>
  </data>
  <data name="CloudRemoveDeviceButton.Content" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Remove</value>
  </data>
  <data name="SubtitleThreats.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Real detections reported by Microsoft Defender. Removal runs through Defender and is verified before success is shown.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="AskAiAboutThreatButton.Content" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Ask BECETTI AI to explain this</value>
  </data>
  <data name="SubtitlePrivacy.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Measured network, TLS and configuration checks. Recommendations come from the measured values only.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="SubtitleHistory.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Local log of real events recorded by BECETTI SECURITY. Nothing is seeded or invented.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="SubtitleUpdates.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Application updates and security-intelligence updates are separate. Each is checked through its real channel.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="SubtitleSettings.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Every setting here is stored and applied. Nothing is decorative.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="SubtitleAbout.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Your Digital Protection Center</value>
  </data>
  <data name="SubtitleAi.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Ask BECETTI AI about your security status. It only answers from real, verified information — it never invents a threat or a fix.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="SubtitleContact.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Nothing is sent automatically. This prepares a draft in your own email app — you review and press Send yourself.</value>
  </data>
