  <data name="HelpDialogTitle" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>BECETTI SECURITY — Help</value>
  </data>
  <data name="HelpDialogBody" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>BECETTI SECURITY combines the official local Native YARA Engine (VirusTotal/yara x64) with Microsoft Defender:

• YARA Engine runs real compiled .yar / .yara rules locally on your files and folders, validates every rule with yarac64 before loading, isolates invalid rules, and supports trusted rule repository updates.
• Smart Scan runs both Native YARA local scans and real Microsoft Defender scans (MpCmdRun.exe).
• Gerçek Zamanlı Koruma, Updates, and Tehdit Management read and manage Microsoft Defender through supported Windows interfaces.
• BECETTI AI explains real scan reports and guides you inside the app.

BECETTI SECURITY never simulates or fabricates detections.</value>
